      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Avatar: The Last Hope</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Catra, princess of the Fire Nation, ran away from home five years ago wtih Scorpia, Entrapta and Melog. When things go extremely bad, she's forced to team up with her former childhood bestfriend -Avatar Adora- and her lousy friends in order to get the people she loves back and defeat Fire Lord Prime.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
